B.TH=new A.L(B.v,["The base map is served by OpenFreeMap; map data is by OpenStreetMap contributors under the Open Database License (ODbL 1.0) (openstreetmap.org/copyright). The tile schema is OpenMapTiles. The credit is shown in the corner of every map. OpenStreetMap data is used only as the base map layer.","Haritan\u0131n taban katman\u0131 OpenFreeMap taraf\u0131ndan sunulur; harita verisi OpenStreetMap katk\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131na aittir ve Open Database License (ODbL 1.0) ile lisansl\u0131d\u0131r (openstreetmap.org/copyright). Karo \u015femas\u0131 OpenMapTiles't\u0131r. At\u0131f her haritan\u0131n k\xf6\u015fesinde g\xf6r\xfcn\xfcr. OpenStreetMap verisi yaln\u0131z harita taban katman\u0131 olarak kullan\u0131l\u0131r."],t.w)
